Notes: the lab-tz-begin/lab-tz-skipped/lab-tz-end markers (lines 1390-1392)
prove the mipsel TZ-skip bootstrap ran with no BusyBox wget timeout path;
the window [4/5] -> configured init script closed in ~2 s (03:03:59 -> 03:04:01).
The seven service steps (S98labprobe) run over loopback SSH (port 8022), so
they leave no UART trace by design; their proof is the committed-contract
expect chain in report.json (RUNNING 1 / FIRST_SAVED / RUNNING 2 /
RESTART_VERIFIED / LAB_CLEANED), see uart-scan-summary.txt.
The first dropbear child-connection line after the window (03:04:02) was
omitted from this excerpt because it quotes the guest-side forward address.
